OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FPatchy rain
OL,6,Fwill turn heavy by late evening. Heavy
OL,7,Frain clears east to only a few light
OL,8,Fshowers towards dawn. Brisk southerly
OL,9,Fwinds easing overnight.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTuesday:FA mix of scattered showers
OL,12,Fand brighter spells during the
OL,13,Fmorning. Outbreaks building for the
OL,14,Fafternoon, bringing the risk of
OL,15,Fthunderstorms to Argyll late
OL,16,Fafternoon. Brisk southwest winds.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
