OL,5,COutlook for Wednesday to Friday:
OL,6,FWednesday very windy with occasional
OL,7,Frain, which turns heavy at times. Rain
OL,8,Fearly Thursday, clearing to leave
OL,9,Fshowers and brighter spells from late
OL,10,FThursday.
